Package: cmna
Type: Package
Title: Computational Methods for Numerical Analysis
Version: 1.99.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Authors@R: person(given = "James", family = "Howard",
                  email = "jh@jameshoward.us", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4530-1547"))
URL: https://jameshoward.us/cmna/,
    https://github.com/k3jph/cmna-pkg
BugReports: https://github.com/k3jph/cmna-pkg/issues
Description: Provides readable, pure-R implementations of standard numerical
    analysis algorithms to accompany James P. Howard, II,
    "Computational Methods for Numerical Analysis with R"
    <https://jameshoward.us/cmna/>. Covers root finding, linear algebra,
    interpolation, numerical differentiation and integration, optimization,
    and differential equations. Every algorithm is implemented transparently
    so the mathematical steps can be studied alongside the code.
License: BSD_2_clause + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    markdown
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
